		(property "Note" "Pin-for-pin copy of Red Pitaya extension connector E1 (2x13, 2.54 mm; straight 26-way ribbon): 1-2 +3V3, 25-26 GND, 5 SPI_MISO, 7 SPI_CS_DAC, 9 SPI_CS_ADC2, 11 SPI_CS_ADC, 12 FAULT_N, 13 SPI_SCLK, 15 SPI_MOSI, 17 ENABLE. Pin order set by the PCB placement (J3 pin 1 down: 17 ... 5 run like U6 A-D, U7 A-D). 3 / 4 = Red Pitaya external trigger in / out, left free. One SPI bus, three chip selects. See ICD_J3.md"
